{"4009440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't answer", "steam_appid": 4009440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Answer! : The Forgotten Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this dark adventure filled with horror and secrets.<br><br>You are a detective following the trail of a mysterious case, searching for a missing figure. Your path leads you into a forgotten forest, where you uncover dead bodies, terrifying creatures, and chilling recordings hidden on old tapes and voice recorders.<br><br>Every discovery drags you deeper into the nightmare, and the truth waiting for you is far darker than you could ever imagine.<br><br>And remember… <strong>Don’t Answer!</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/extras/037a6e2ad477fe3ea3da8d939f0923ad.poster.avif?t=1758125973\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/extras/037a6e2ad477fe3ea3da8d939f0923ad.webm?t=1758125973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person story-driven horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, driving, and branching conversations that shape the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover old voice recorders and tapes revealing disturbing secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters and haunting shadows that stalk you in the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological puzzles and escalating horror as the story unfolds.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments with photo-realistic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic for a nostalgic yet unsettling tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find audio tapes and recorders that uncover chilling backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover disturbing tales of murder, loss, and the horrors lurking in the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter monstrous entities tied to the forest’s dark past.  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Answer! : The Forgotten Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this dark adventure filled with horror and secrets.<br><br>You are a detective following the trail of a mysterious case, searching for a missing figure. Your path leads you into a forgotten forest, where you uncover dead bodies, terrifying creatures, and chilling recordings hidden on old tapes and voice recorders.<br><br>Every discovery drags you deeper into the nightmare, and the truth waiting for you is far darker than you could ever imagine.<br><br>And remember… <strong>Don’t Answer!</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/extras/037a6e2ad477fe3ea3da8d939f0923ad.poster.avif?t=1758125973\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/extras/037a6e2ad477fe3ea3da8d939f0923ad.webm?t=1758125973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person story-driven horror experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, driving, and branching conversations that shape the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover old voice recorders and tapes revealing disturbing secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters and haunting shadows that stalk you in the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological puzzles and escalating horror as the story unfolds.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments with photo-realistic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic for a nostalgic yet unsettling tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find audio tapes and recorders that uncover chilling backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover disturbing tales of murder, loss, and the horrors lurking in the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter monstrous entities tied to the forest’s dark past.  </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You must stay alive in this mysterious adventure filled with horror and secrets.You are a detective following the trail of a dark case searching for a known figure but every step drags you deeper into the forest.There you will face hidden truths eerie puzzles, and a past that refuses to stay buried.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/e3408a4f279a1f215cd63afcedbf01972cd93b46/header.jpg?t=1758125973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/8d7859949d62d850dfb22d7b2517ff24f9ac324d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758125973", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009440/8d7859949d62d850dfb22d7b2517ff24f9ac324d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758125973", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4570 / AMD FX-6